# Markdown is local by default (skill docs, design notes, test-case docs etc.
# don't belong in the public repo). Exceptions below are product documentation
# that has to ship with the code: compliance evidence is only credible if it is
# versioned alongside what it describes, the migration note is the record of
# why the legacy tree still exists, and the architecture overview is the
# reference for reviewers.
*.md
!README.md
!docs/compliance/*.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!modules/jumpserver-legacy/MIGRATION.md
docs/designs/
